OL,3,A'Glam, funny, kind': World remembers
OL,4,ADolly Parton as star dies from cancer
OL,5,Aaged 80
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd she had a very keen eye for
OL,8,Fbusiness, even offering a signature
OL,9,Fcoffee brand called Cup of Ambition, in
OL,10,Fa nod to her Grammy-winning single 9 to
OL,11,F5
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/20
